      "limitations": [
        "Complete native RER hard-coal power-plant construction and dismantling replaces the global source market per signed plant unit, factor +1. Preserve caller quantity, uncertainty, formula and separately listed infrastructure, operating energy and emissions; add no lifetime or capacity multiplier.",
